LOCUS       tetR_tetA_promot          56 bp    DNA              UNK 01-JAN-1980
DEFINITION  The Tn10 divergent tetA/tetR control region: 56 bp carrying the
            PtetA promoter, the overlapping PtetR promoter, and the two TetR
            operators tetO1 and tetO2..
